// stylePreflight, and what only it reaches
//
// The template ReflowPreflight (src/views/Reflow.cpp) deep-clones and
// fills: the different font families, sizes, faces and styles a page's
// views use, each an array, so that the paper roll's print layout can see
// whether a page is all in one family.

stylePreflight := {family: [|Array|: ], size: [|Array|: ], face: [|Array|: ], styles: [|Array|: ]};
